<view class="page"><view class="title">WebSocket 连接测试</view><view>仅向当前平台同组织内已连接的管理员发送。关闭页面会断开，不保存聊天记录。</view><view class="status">{{status}}</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{!connected}}" bindtap="connect" disabled="{{connecting}}">连接</button><button wx:else bindtap="disconnect">断开</button><view>接收人编号（留空表示所有已连接管理员）</view><input value="{{target}}" data-key="target" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" type="number"/><view>消息内容</view><textarea value="{{text}}" data-key="text" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button wx:if="{{canSend}}" bindtap="send" disabled="{{!connected || busy || uncertain}}">{{busy ? '等待确认' : '发送消息'}}</button><button wx:if="{{uncertain}}" bindtap="acknowledge" disabled="{{busy}}">核对后清空输入并解除锁定</button><view class="title">本页接收记录</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key"><view>{{item.time}} · 管理员 {{item.sender}}</view><text selectable>{{item.text}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">暂无接收记录</view></view>
